function cinemaExternalTick(){const s=cinemaSession();if(!s||!_cin.provider)return;const t=cinemaCurrentTime(),d=cinemaDuration();if(t>=0)s.progress=t;if(d)s.duration=d;s.updatedAt=Date.now();cinemaUpdateSubtitle();cinemaSyncMediaControls();if(Date.now()-_cin.lastSaveAt>5000)cinemaSaveProgress(false);}
